  "t": "mean / std(ddof = 1) x sqrt(194), undefined when the std is below 1e-12 or the result is not finite",
  "world": "a holdout block of 194 consecutive pool sessions, circular inside one pool, weighted by the number of Validation blocks (250 sessions, circular inside one pool) that share no session with it",
