  "HO": "HO[k] = the weight of the holdout blocks with sum x0 > 1e-12 and a defined t >= k / 100",
  "k_cell": "the smallest k in 0..500 with HO[k] x 100 <= 12 x T; k_p = the largest k_cell; k_used = max(k_XS, k_p + 5)"
